# File Structure

## Source Code
- `src/` — C source files for all game systems (battle, overworld, menus, UI, etc.)
- `src/data/` — C data tables (trainer parties, species data, item data, graphics refs)
- `include/` — Header files mirroring `src/` structure
- `include/constants/` — Enums and `#define` constants (items, species, moves, maps, flags, vars)
- `include/config/` — Feature toggle headers; primary place to configure engine behavior
- `include/gba/` — Low-level GBA hardware register definitions

## Assembly & Scripts
- `asm/` — Hand-written ARM/Thumb assembly
- `asm/macros/` — Scripting macros: `battle_script_commands.inc`, `event.inc`, `field_effect_script.inc`
- `data/scripts/` — Map event scripts (`.inc` files, one per map)
- `data/maps/` — Map layouts and metadata in JSON format

## Assets
- `graphics/` — Source PNGs and converted binary assets (`.4bpp`, `.gbapal`, etc.)
- `sound/` — Music (`.s` assembly) and sound effects

## Tests
- `test/` — Test suite organized by feature; each file is a battle/script scenario
- Run with `make check` — results appear in the mGBA test runner

## Tools & Docs
- `tools/` — Custom build tools (`gbagfx`, `scaninc`, `preproc`, `trainerproc`, etc.)
- `docs/tutorials/` — Step-by-step guides: adding Pokémon, moves, trainers, battle commands
- `migration_scripts/` — Python scripts for migrating between expansion versions

## Where to Add Things
| Task | Location |
|------|----------|
| New Pokémon species | `src/data/pokemon/`, `include/constants/species.h` |
| New move | `src/data/moves.h`, `include/constants/moves.h`, `src/battle_script_commands.c` |
| New trainer | `src/data/trainers.h`, `include/constants/trainers.h` |
| New map script | `data/scripts/<MapName>.inc` |
| New item | `src/data/items.h`, `include/constants/items.h` |
| New battle AI flag | `include/constants/battle_ai.h`, `src/battle_ai_main.c` |
